  "title": "NUTEX HEALTH REOPENS RED RIVER ER & HOSPITAL IN TEXAS",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, Nov. 24, 2025 /PRNewswire/ — Nutex Health Inc. (“Nutex Health” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: NUTX), a physician-led, integrated healthcare delivery system comprised of 25 state-of-the-art micro hospitals and hospital outpatient departments (HOPDs) in 11 states and primary care-centric, risk-bearing physician networks, today announced the reopening of Red River ER & Hospital in Sherman, Texas. […]",
